        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo CV-2414-SL, Sargent Integra Mortise Lock Conversion Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis filler plate allows for the conversion from an old Sargent Integra Mortise Lock to standard tube latches. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-CV-2414_size.gif?v=1704354549\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo CV-2414 Sargent conversion plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nJust remove the old Sargent Mortise Lock box. Screw the filler plate into the doors edge existing mortise lock holes. You can now install a standard latch. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo CV-2414-SL Conversion Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Sliver Painted</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CV-2414.pdf?v=1704262258\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo CV-2414 Conversion Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
